### System Health Live
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/system/health/live

### System Health Ready
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/system/health/ready

### Auth Register
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "API User",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123456",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

### Auth Login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123456"
}

### Auth Refresh
# Note: Refresh token cookie is required (handled by the client/browser/HTTP client automatically)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/refresh

### Auth Current User (Replace Token)
